  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2gd95w5/baner-decorative-pavers.png\" alt=\"baner-decorative-pavers\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">装饰性鹅卵石是一个 Minecraft 模组，添加了多种鹅卵石用于装饰你的街道、房屋等。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用该模组后，你将能够使用不同类型的石头和木板，由<strong>石头、花岗岩、安山岩、闪长岩、深板岩、方解石、凝灰岩、滴水石块、鹅卵石、红砂岩、砂岩以及橡木、云杉、白桦、丛林、金合欢、深色橡木、绯红、诡异和红树林木板</strong>组成，为你的建筑打造精致优雅的设计。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GMQ2Cy5/paver2.png\" alt=\"paver2\" width=\"1044\" height=\"295\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">新增2种方块</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mDT8Vsc/paver02.png\" alt=\"paver02\" width=\"234\" height=\"219\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增彩色方块，方块为闪长岩 26/04/24</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2YV9RyN/paver.png\" alt=\"paver\" width=\"922\" height=\"915\"></strong></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">彩色花岗岩方块仅用于制作彩色花岗岩鹅卵石，不具备作为建筑方块的用途。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">彩色花岗岩方块在工作台上合成，使用花岗岩方块和染料，可使用的染料有</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">白色、灰色、黑色、棕色、红色、黄色、绿色、蓝色、品红色，合成后可获得5个方块</span><br><br></span></strong></span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span>要获取彩色铺路石，你必须使用切石机</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span><br></span></strong></span></pre>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zZrTS4p/crafting-diorite-color.png\" alt=\"crafting-diorite-color\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>要制作这些鹅卵石，你只需要切石机即可&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1vM477h/03.png\" alt=\"03\" width=\"1070\" height=\"252\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">要制作任意彩色方块，只需将制作该彩色方块对应的原始方块放入切石机中即可。</span></strong></span></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DttDBPt/crafting.png\" alt=\"crafting\" width=\"865\" height=\"272\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
